      "finding": "Real WireError wrapper and remote type/message/phase/frames plus normalized outcome are persisted before unchanged execute-phase/candidate-frame guards. Local errors are recorded but remain rejected as Guest outcomes. Optional private capture sink is enabled only for missing-raw control.",
